msgstr "Cannot switch to "{}": The required system font for this language is not installed on Windows."

msgid "無法切換至「{}」：找不到該語言的翻譯檔案或語言包已損毀。"
msgstr "Cannot switch to "{}": The translation file for this language is missing or corrupted."

